  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">AzulBotanicals offers healthy, natrual, homeopathic alternatives to the beauty &amp; health world.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>Product description:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our products are free from harmful chemicals and additives, making our balms safe for all skin types. Combining the benefits of grass-fed tallow base or Shea butter base with other gentle, natural oils to provide a wholesome solution for healthy, radiant skin.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">GHK-Cu - major ingredient for anti-aging, fine lines wrinkles, it is a copper peptide also helps with cell regeneration formany topical ailments/concerns. it's benefits are boosted by sunrise and sunset.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">-Methylene Blue - promotes for anti-aging, skin healing, reduces scars and stretchmarks, relieves rashes and skin irritants/immune responses. Antimicrobial, and high in antioxidants, collagen, vitamins A, B1, D, E, K, this balm is truly food for your skin.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Tallow - This organic beef tallow moisturizer is packed with essential vitamins A, D, E, and K. Vitamin A smoothens the skin, Vitamin D helps repair skin damage and supports healing, Vitamin E provides deep hydration, while Vitamin K reduces dark circles and improves skin elasticity</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Shea butter - a vegan-conscious option with comparable results. The ingredients brought together in this balm also promotes for anti-aging, skin healing, fades scars and stretchmarks, relieves rashes and skin irritants/immune responses. Antimicrobial, high in antioxidants, collagen, with vitamins A, B1, D, E, K this balm is food for the skin. Made with all organic ingredients.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Payment terms:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>You will get a 5%-10% commission per referral sales when a customer makes a purchase through your affiliate link or uses your coupon code. This percent is based on customers purchase amount (taxes and shipping not included).</span></li>\r\n</ul>",
